{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"1718867188","y":0.046511627815394085,"x":0.7716049391467531,"w":0.069958845774332645,"c":0.5},{"x":0.11723973786310438,"y":0.05368124667889751,"w":0.057701594034830744,"c":1,"h":0.01327704147680342,"t":"Test 4"},{"w":0.016460905075073251,"c":1,"x":0.11728395065176381,"y":0.57848837186645785,"t":"H","h":0.013081395583944722},{"x":0.15843621440771272,"w":0.73045267740885422,"c":1,"h":0.01744185965530165,"t":"faithfully when needed, updated with each player's moves, and then reliably stored","y":0.095930232745023547},{"w":0.6975308227539061,"y":0.11336866888783226,"c":1,"h":0.015991795610623361,"x":0.16049385048004269,"t":"again, so the brain can move on to the next board. First moves can be tough to"},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.13074204923249766,"w":0.72222223917643236,"t":"remember because they are fairly uninteresting. But the ends of games are taxing","x":0.15843620541879838,"c":1},{"y":0.14680232544804794,"c":1,"t":"too, as exhaustion sets in. When Gareyev is tired, his recall can get patchy. He","x":0.16049383147596852,"w":0.69341562906901044,"h":0.014563987898180697},{"h":0.020415677900729956,"c":1,"x":0.16038724508380275,"w":0.68132364908854171,"t":"sometimes makes moves based on only a fragmented memory of the pieces'","y":0.16128930382184048},{"x":0.1604938283062384,"y":0.18023255788779557,"t":"positions.","w":0.0884773635864258,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"t":"The scientists first had Gareyev perform some standard memory tests. These","x":0.160493816063221,"w":0.68312759399414058,"c":1,"y":0.21366279056475201,"h":0.014546867815428799},{"y":0.22755564811526519,"t":"assessed his ability to hold numbers, pictures and words in mind. One classic test","x":0.16037067572567518,"h":0.01992018062739831,"c":1,"w":0.72248163859049475},{"t":"measures how many numbers a person can repeat, both forwards and backwards,","x":0.16249955667040392,"c":1,"y":0.24520629908722591,"w":0.72645894368489583,"h":0.016443526084908844},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"w":0.63786010742187504,"y":0.26295641952350013,"x":0.16255142767754865,"t":"soon after hearing them. Most people manage about seven. 'He was not"},{"y":0.27906976729527666,"x":0.16049382673429344,"w":0.72427983601888024,"c":1,"t":"exceptional on any of these standard tests,' said Rissman. 'We didn't find anything","h":0.01598837238037687},{"h":0.017664538676662955,"y":0.29469748228338521,"w":0.7141090393066406,"t":"other than playing chess that he seems to be supremely gifted at.' But next came","c":1,"x":0.16043389057917731},{"x":0.15843620538219436,"w":0.72222223917643225,"y":0.31242638383394028,"t":"the brain scans. With Gareyev lying down in the machine, Rissman looked at how","h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"w":0.7037036641438803,"h":0.016034595817502995,"x":0.16049385126139309,"t":"well connected the various regions of the chess player's brain were. Though the","c":1,"y":0.32848837231113748},{"c":1,"w":0.70576131184895829,"t":"results are tentative and as yet unpublished, the scans found much greater than","x":0.15843621640228303,"y":0.34593023241188392,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"y":0.36336866909781806,"t":"average communication between parts of Gareyev's brain that make up what is","w":0.69958847045898431,"h":0.01453830777405285,"x":0.16049383054526553,"c":1},{"t":"called the frontoparietal control network. Of 63 people scanned alongside the chess","x":0.16049382485049232,"y":0.37926972886840926,"w":0.73662551879882809,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054074},{"w":0.73662551879882809,"t":"player, only one or two scored more highly on the measure. 'You use this network in","y":0.39534883706125712,"c":1,"x":0.16049382490088496,"h":0.016017476296396826},{"c":1,"t":"almost any complex task. It helps you to allocate attention, keep rules in mind, and","x":0.16049383490796362,"w":0.72633743286132812,"y":0.41279069752845121,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"c":1,"y":0.42726737318854735,"t":"work out whether you should be responding or not,' said Rissman.","x":0.16049383504864712,"w":0.58436213175455731,"h":0.017500068048987072},{"h":0.016000356213644928,"y":0.46220930217786715,"c":1,"t":"It was not the only hint of something special in Gareyev's brain. The scans also","x":0.15843621735395555,"w":0.69958847045898442},{"t":"suggest that Gareyev's visual network is more highly connected to other brain parts","y":0.47819767426963367,"w":0.7345679219563801,"x":0.1604938166340249,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1},{"y":0.49558303881484889,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"than usual. Initial results suggest that the areas of his brain that process visual","x":0.15843621828473101,"c":1,"w":0.69341562906901044},{"t":"images - such as chess boards - may have stronger links to other brain regions,","h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"x":0.15843620634774302,"y":0.51148409914648396,"w":0.71604939778645837},{"y":0.52906976729579736,"c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.16049382486015229,"t":"and so be more powerful than normal. While the analyses are not finalised yet, they","w":0.73662551879882809},{"y":0.54505300369959786,"w":0.50617284138997398,"h":0.01599350806821509,"x":0.16049382611959492,"t":"may hold the first clues to Gareyev's extraordinary ability.","c":1},{"h":0.016034596379148724,"y":0.57848837194704261,"w":0.72839508056640623,"t":"For the world record attempt, Gareyev hopes to play 47 blindfold games at once in","c":1,"x":0.15843620446899384},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.5944767440523121,"t":"about 16 hours. He will need to win 80% to claim the title. 'I don't worry too much","w":0.7098765563964845,"c":1,"x":0.16255143361978705},{"w":0.69753087361653643,"x":0.16049382687485927,"y":0.60895170838188328,"c":1,"h":0.018955267781503582,"t":"about the winning percentage, that's never been an issue for me,' he said. 'The"},{"y":0.62779740851772325,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"w":0.73045267740885422,"t":"most important part of blindfold chess for me is that I have found the one thing that","x":0.16049382580559174},{"t":"I can fully dedicate myself to. I miss having an obsession.'","c":1,"x":0.15630520981212886,"w":0.51870086669921878,"h":0.018697928483691229,"y":0.64240897641174088},{"c":1,"x":0.11522633755171977,"w":0.024691357612609849,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"90","y":0.86773255797690307},{"c":1,"x":0.66991094639740412,"h":0.033792529426278195,"y":0.95311055968589831,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.30613845825195307}]}